<title>CANADA: Loewen says it bought 51 units since Sept.</title>
<headline>Loewen says it bought 51 units since Sept.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Loewen Group Inc said it had acquired 51 independent funeral homes and cemeteries for about $325 million since Service Corp International made its hostile bid for the company on September 17.</p>
<p>The acquisitions are a sign the 51 independent proprietors see Loewen warding off the hostile bid and remaining independent, the company added.</p>
<p>Service Corp offered $43 a share for Loewen in September.</p>
<p>Loewen said it has made $1.4 billion of acquisitions in 1996 to date.</p>
</text>
